    },
    {
      "displayText": "Genesect is an ancient bug Pokémon. Apparently,\nit was altered by a certain organization.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt also can be equipped with four different kinds\nof drives...or so they say.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
