      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F007500720020006400720069007600650073002000490020006A00750073007400200073006F002000680061007000700065006E00200074006F00200068006100760065002000610063007100750069007200650064002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why don’t you buy them off me? I’ve got some\nvery interesting info to share once you get all four.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you not hear me? I said to get all four drives.\nThey’re yours—if you bring me the Mega Shards.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd if you’ve given any shards to a Pokémon to\nhold, hurry up and put them back in your satchel.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 199
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look at that. You got all four drives.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat took some effort. You’ve earned my special\nbit of intel.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
